    "safe_failure_method": "Allocate a real MatrixSlab, verify the computed reserved layout fits it, call fieds_from_ptr with in-allocation base offsets, and inspect raw slice length/address metadata only. No returned slice is dereferenced, no possibly oversized slice reference is formed, and MatrixSlab::alloc is not called by the regression. Thus the pre-fix extent error is demonstrated without reproducing the invalid-reference construction in the production alloc path.",
